data: {"id": "b207cd9efbaa4d18-thinking-parallel_evidence-1219", "run_id": "b207cd9efbaa4d18", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 事实与冲突\n\n**Pod 生命周期**\n- `aiops-case-v06/workload` 运行在 `node2` (10.2.0.50)，UID `f0ed729b-e64a-4bd6-8065-3af3efc737f8`。\n- 当前阶段：`Pending`（之前报告为 `ContainerCreating`，本质是同一等待阶段的体现），原因 `ContainerCreating`，`status.message/reason` 均为 `<none>`。\n- 容器 `app`（镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，command: `python3 -u -c ...`）状态 `Waiting / ContainerCreating`，重启 0 次，尚未创建成功。\n- YAML 确认只有一个 container `app` 和单个 volume `input`，类型为 `HostPath`，路径 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input`。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789129731411, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "b207cd9efbaa4d18-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "b207cd9efbaa4d18", "seq": 1220, "ts_ms": 1789129737223, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 43.668, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v06", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/b207cd9efbaa4d18-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "4b94c301e3fea0709ab43b24fabfd57cadfb63d0116ebd0feb76b36e013f0e0f", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "10e06979bb761df0d346c99e765bc83d05db841edcf158ec32647487a3da3ee3"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "b207cd9efbaa4d18-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "b207cd9efbaa4d18", "seq": 1221, "ts_ms": 1789129737223, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "b207cd9efbaa4d18-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "b207cd9efbaa4d18", "seq": 1222, "ts_ms": 1789129745395, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.172, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1630, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v06/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` 引用了一个节点 `node2` 上未正确创建的 HostPath 卷 `input`，路径 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` 实际不是目录，导致 kubelet 挂载失败并持续阻塞 Pod。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedMount`: `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a directory` (fact-92f061fbcff9) | 明确根因：指定的 HostPath 路径不存在或类型不符 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubelet | `pod.status`: `Pending` (fact-145ea22d2b27) | 确认 Pod 处于阻塞状态，无法进入运行阶段 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubelet | `pod.condition`: `ContainersReady=False`, reason=`ContainersNotReady` (fact-c92cda7af738) | 确认容器就绪检查失败，无法提供服务 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubelet | `container.waiting_reason`: `ContainerCreating` (fact-a3fc0abd5d12) | 确认容器卡在创建阶段，尚未启动进程 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason=`ContainerCreating`) (fact-5134823997ad) | 数值监控印证了 Pod 持续卡在 ContainerCreating 状态 |\n\n证据表明，Pod 因 kubelet 挂载 HostPath 卷失败而阻塞在 Pending 状态，所有等待/非就绪指标均指向同一挂载故障，无资源争用或应用崩溃迹象。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n节点 node2 上路径 /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input 实际不是目录 → kubelet HostPath type check failed → Pod 挂载卷 input 失败 → Pod 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 阻塞状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` 引用的 HostPath 卷 `input` 路径配置错误**（事实 `fact-92f061fbcff9` 明确指出 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` 不是目录）。该配置缺陷直接导致 kubelet 挂载失败，进而使得 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态且无法启动容器。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v06/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` 引用了一个节点 `node2` 上未正确创建的 HostPath 卷 `input`，路径 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` 实际不是目录，导致 kubelet 挂载失败并持续阻塞 Pod。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedMount`: `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a directory` (fact-92f061fbcff9) | 明确根因：指定的 HostPath 路径不存在或类型不符 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubelet | `pod.status`: `Pending` (fact-145ea22d2b27) | 确认 Pod 处于阻塞状态，无法进入运行阶段 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubelet | `pod.condition`: `ContainersReady=False`, reason=`ContainersNotReady` (fact-c92cda7af738) | 确认容器就绪检查失败，无法提供服务 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubelet | `container.waiting_reason`: `ContainerCreating` (fact-a3fc0abd5d12) | 确认容器卡在创建阶段，尚未启动进程 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason=`ContainerCreating`) (fact-5134823997ad) | 数值监控印证了 Pod 持续卡在 ContainerCreating 状态 |\n\n证据表明，Pod 因 kubelet 挂载 HostPath 卷失败而阻塞在 Pending 状态，所有等待/非就绪指标均指向同一挂载故障，无资源争用或应用崩溃迹象。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n节点 node2 上路径 /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input 实际不是目录 → kubelet HostPath type check failed → Pod 挂载卷 input 失败 → Pod 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 阻塞状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` 引用的 HostPath 卷 `input` 路径配置错误**（事实 `fact-92f061fbcff9` 明确指出 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` 不是目录）。该配置缺陷直接导致 kubelet 挂载失败，进而使得 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态且无法启动容器。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

