data: {"id": "b207cd9efbaa4d18-final", "run_id": "b207cd9efbaa4d18", "seq": 1224, "ts_ms": 1789129745407, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v06/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` 引用了一个节点 `node2` 上未正确创建的 HostPath 卷 `input`，路径 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` 实际不是目录，导致 kubelet 挂载失败并持续阻塞 Pod。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedMount`: `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a directory` (fact-92f061fbcff9) | 明确根因：指定的 HostPath 路径不存在或类型不符 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubelet | `pod.status`: `Pending` (fact-145ea22d2b27) | 确认 Pod 处于阻塞状态，无法进入运行阶段 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubelet | `pod.condition`: `ContainersReady=False`, reason=`ContainersNotReady` (fact-c92cda7af738) | 确认容器就绪检查失败，无法提供服务 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubelet | `container.waiting_reason`: `ContainerCreating` (fact-a3fc0abd5d12) | 确认容器卡在创建阶段，尚未启动进程 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason=`ContainerCreating`) (fact-5134823997ad) | 数值监控印证了 Pod 持续卡在 ContainerCreating 状态 |\n\n证据表明，Pod 因 kubelet 挂载 HostPath 卷失败而阻塞在 Pending 状态，所有等待/非就绪指标均指向同一挂载故障，无资源争用或应用崩溃迹象。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n节点 node2 上路径 /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input 实际不是目录 → kubelet HostPath type check failed → Pod 挂载卷 input 失败 → Pod 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 阻塞状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` 引用的 HostPath 卷 `input` 路径配置错误**（事实 `fact-92f061fbcff9` 明确指出 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` 不是目录）。该配置缺陷直接导致 kubelet 挂载失败，进而使得 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态且无法启动容器。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 43.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v06/workload: 43.7s (Evidence 37.9s, RCA 5.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v06/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 68.969, "metrics": {"run_id": "b207cd9efbaa4d18", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 68.97375750541687, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 68973.75750541687, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 64599.57480430603, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 14, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 16, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 10070.507287979126, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4019.4900035858154}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms":